====== Actiontec MI424WR ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The Actiontec MI424WR comes in many hardware versions. This page covers the versions based on the [[http://download.intel.com/design/network/ProdBrf/27905105.pdf|Intel X-Scale 533MHz IXP425]].
It has a coax interface and IEEE 802.11g support.

There are also available:

  * [[https://www.actiontec.com/products/product.php?pid=188#.UV8Td8qyI_k | Rev E]] (SoC Cavium 5020@300MHz)
  * [[https://www.actiontec.com/products/product.php?pid=213#.UV8TeMqyI_k | Rev F]] (SoC Cavium 5020@300MHz)
  * [[https://www.actiontec.com/214.html | Rev G]] (SoC Cavium 5020@500MHz)
  * [[toh:actiontec:mi424wr_rev._i|Rev I]] (SoC Marvell@1.2GHz)

